      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3085,
      "text": "They said, “You are but one of those who are bewitched!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 153,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 373,
      "ruku": 323,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3086,
      "text": "You are but a human like us, so bring a sign if you are one of the truthful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 154,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 373,
      "ruku": 323,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3087,
      "text": "Sālih said, “This is a she-camel[18]; she will have her share of water and you will have yours, each on a specified day.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 155,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 373,
      "ruku": 323,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3088,
      "text": "Do not touch her with harm, or you will be seized by the punishment of a horrible day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 156,
